{
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:31:28",
      "utterance": "こんにちは　相談員です。ご相談にお越しいただきありがとうございます。今日はどのようなご相談でしょうか。",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:32:02",
      "utterance": "もう疲れてしまいました",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:32:31",
      "utterance": "全部私が悪いのです",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:32:53",
      "utterance": "疲れてしまったのですね。私が悪いと思われているんですね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:33:08",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:33:30",
      "utterance": "よろしかったら、ご年齢と性別を教えていただけないでしょうか。",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:34:09",
      "utterance": "50代後半男です",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:34:29",
      "utterance": "ありがとうございます。疲れてしまったのは、お仕事上のことでしょうか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:34:51",
      "utterance": "そうです",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:35:16",
      "utterance": "よろしければ、もうすこし詳しくお話を聞かせていただけないでしょうか。",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:35:58",
      "utterance": "コロナの影響で仕事が激減してしまった",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:36:22",
      "utterance": "コロナの影響なのですね。お仕事は営業のお仕事でしょうか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:37:07",
      "utterance": "土木関係の仕事",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:37:32",
      "utterance": "土木関係の現場のお仕事でしょうか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:37:44",
      "utterance": "そうです",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:38:19",
      "utterance": "最近は夏の暑さの中での仕事で",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:38:38",
      "utterance": "今年は特に暑いですよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:38:57",
      "utterance": "体力的にもきつい",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:39:06",
      "utterance": "それにマスクをしてのお仕事は大変ですよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:39:25",
      "utterance": "毎日現場には行かれるのでしょうか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:40:15",
      "utterance": "いや家のローン事業の借金が残っている",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:40:43",
      "utterance": "ローンと、それと事業の借金ですか。",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:41:21",
      "utterance": "そうです",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:41:40",
      "utterance": "収入が激減ということでしたが、それらの支払が滞るほどでしょうか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:42:41",
      "utterance": "子どもへ仕送りもできない",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:42:59",
      "utterance": "仕送りもあるのですね。それは大変ですよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:43:36",
      "utterance": "失礼ですが、奥様とはこのようなことはお話されたでしょうか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:43:56",
      "utterance": "全部わたしが悪い",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:44:39",
      "utterance": "昨年の夏から妻は実家に帰ってしまっている",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:44:40",
      "utterance": "そう思われているのですね。コロナの仕事減は、あなたが悪いわけではないと思うのですが。",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:45:05",
      "utterance": "ごめんなさい。奥様はご実家に？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:45:21",
      "utterance": "そうです",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:45:40",
      "utterance": "なぜでしょうか？差し支えなければお聞かせ願えますか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:46:06",
      "utterance": "私が悪かった",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:46:33",
      "utterance": "妻はよく頑張ってくれていた",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:46:50",
      "utterance": "奥様は頑張ってくださっていたのですね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:47:15",
      "utterance": "自分が勝手だった",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:47:33",
      "utterance": "勝手？さきほど事業の借金と仰っていましたが、どういうことでしょうか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:48:26",
      "utterance": "事業の借金は返せると思っていた",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:48:48",
      "utterance": "自分にはそれぐらいできると",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:48:56",
      "utterance": "コロナが無ければ、返せる計画の借金だったのですね？",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:49:38",
      "utterance": "そう思いたい",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:49:44",
      "utterance": "個人事業主として、土木の現場で働いていらっしゃるということでしょうか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:50:31",
      "utterance": "社員もいる",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:50:54",
      "utterance": "面倒みてやっていたんだ",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:50:54",
      "utterance": "法人として経営をしていらっしゃるのですね？",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:51:19",
      "utterance": "社員さんの面倒をみていらっしゃったのですね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:51:27",
      "utterance": "みんな俺に着いてきてくれていた",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:51:48",
      "utterance": "ああ、頼られるタイプの親分肌なのですね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:52:20",
      "utterance": "どの位の金額の借金なのですか？よろしければ教えてください。",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:53:00",
      "utterance": "事業は5000万",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:53:20",
      "utterance": "住宅は3000万",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:53:28",
      "utterance": "残っている",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:53:54",
      "utterance": "大きな金額ですね。返せると思っていたのに、コロナのせいで計画が狂ってしまったということですね。",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:54:19",
      "utterance": "今となってはただ調子に乗っていただけだった",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:54:37",
      "utterance": "調子に乗っていたとは？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:55:02",
      "utterance": "景気がいい時はみんなに奢ってやっていた",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:55:25",
      "utterance": "そういうものですよ。おごってやりたい気持ちわかります。",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:56:11",
      "utterance": "いまさらどうすれば",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:56:17",
      "utterance": "景気がいい時には、5000万まで貸してくれる金融機関があったのですよね？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:57:06",
      "utterance": "一件の仕事がでかいからそのくらいは必要",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:57:44",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね。コロナの前から、仕掛り、途中の現場はあるのですか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:58:36",
      "utterance": "遅れているのもあるが新しいものが入ってこない",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T19:59:18",
      "utterance": "進行中の仕事はあるけれど、次への新しいお仕事が受注できない　ということですね。",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:00:17",
      "utterance": "そう金が回らない",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:00:28",
      "utterance": "商工会議所など、公的な機関には相談に行かれましたか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:01:03",
      "utterance": "そんなもの無理だろう",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:01:34",
      "utterance": "雇用調整助成金や、持続化給付金のことはご存じでしょうか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:02:42",
      "utterance": "土木の売り上げは毎月一定じゃない",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:03:04",
      "utterance": "小売と違う",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:03:26",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。おっしゃるとおり、次の受注ができないと影響が大きいということですね。それは分かります。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:04:05",
      "utterance": "もう無理だ",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:05:00",
      "utterance": "聞いてもよろしいでしょうか？もしかしたら、死んだら楽になると考えていらっしゃいますか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:05:57",
      "utterance": "今ロープを用意している",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:06:20",
      "utterance": "いま、お一人ですか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:06:43",
      "utterance": "そうだ",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:07:11",
      "utterance": "そんな時でも、ここに相談に来てくださったのですね。",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:07:34",
      "utterance": "これを最後に死のうと決めていた",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:07:57",
      "utterance": "いま、死んでしまったら、会社や、仕送りしているお子さんはどうなるのでしょうか。",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:08:37",
      "utterance": "申し訳ないと思っている",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:08:53",
      "utterance": "申し訳ないと思われるのですね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:09:46",
      "utterance": "もう、もどれない",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:10:00",
      "utterance": "でも死なれてしまって、悲しんでいる、そういう人達の顔を想像できますか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:11:09",
      "utterance": "妻はわたしを恨んでいる",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:11:29",
      "utterance": "恨んでいる？　どうして？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:12:06",
      "utterance": "きつくしすぎた",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:12:25",
      "utterance": "きつくした？　どういう風に？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:13:10",
      "utterance": "全部わたしが悪かった",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:13:30",
      "utterance": "離婚する予定になっている",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:13:46",
      "utterance": "直接、恨んでいると言われたのですか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:14:05",
      "utterance": "そうに決まっているだろ",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:14:23",
      "utterance": "出て行ったんだから",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:14:43",
      "utterance": "子供も連れて",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:15:05",
      "utterance": "出て行ったから、恨まれていると思われたのですね。　仕送り必要なお子様の他に？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:16:02",
      "utterance": "その子たちにだ",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:16:24",
      "utterance": "仕送りは",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:16:39",
      "utterance": "一人になってわかった",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:17:09",
      "utterance": "ひとりになってわかった？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:17:29",
      "utterance": "妻はよく支えてくれていた",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:17:58",
      "utterance": "ああ、奥様は、夫と子どもの家庭をよく支えてくださっていたのですね。",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:18:31",
      "utterance": "奥様に感謝の気持ちは？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:19:09",
      "utterance": "今の状況じゃ言えるはずがない",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:19:53",
      "utterance": "今の状況は、借金とローンのことですね。言える筈がないと思われるのですね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-12T20:20:07",
      "utterance": "これ以上迷惑かけてはいけない",
      "distress_level": 2,
